**Landing Page - Oasis Infobyte Internship (Level 1 - Task 1)**

A responsive travel-themed landing page built using HTML and CSS as part of the Oasis Infobyte Web Development and Designing Internship.

 **Features**
- Clean, modern layout with a custom background visual
- Structured navigation and call-to-action sections
- Styled with custom CSS for visual hierarchy and alignment
** Tech Stack**
- HTML5
- CSS3
